/**
 * The names that get pasted *into* a message, rather than being one.
 *
 * Validation and the verification blockers build their sentences around a field
 * name — "Full name is required.", "Passport is missing from this case." — so the
 * sentence can only be translated if the name inside it can be too. These are the
 * names, keyed by the exact English word the schema passes in.
 *
 * A phrase is translated only when **every** name in it is known, so a sentence
 * built around a name nobody has taught this table is left in English instead of
 * coming out half-translated.
 */
